    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a string-type element in the JSON schema validation system. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class models a JSON string element and provides mechanisms for validating configuration values according to constraints such as enumeration of allowed values, minimum and maximum length, and regular expression patterns.</para>
<para>It inherits from <ref refid="class_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref> and implements the required validation logic for string-based schema elements. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
